mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue marker:font-bold","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"I am looking for a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"durable"}]," paint that is ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"waterproof"}]," for outdoor use.\"\r\n",["$","em","em-0",{"children":["(실외용으로 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"방수"}]," 기능이 있는 ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"내구성"}]," 좋은 페인트를 찾고 있습니다.)"]}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"What type of ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"sealant"}]," would you recommend for sealing the edges of the bathtub?\"\r\n",["$","em","em-0",{"children":["(욕조 모서리를 밀봉하기 위해 어떤 종류의 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"밀봉제"}],"를 추천하시나요?)"]}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"I need to find a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"replacement gasket"}]," for my old washing machine model, number 500.\"\r\n",["$","em","em-0",{"children":["(제 오래된 세탁기 모델 500번을 위한 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"교체용 개스킷"}],"을 찾아야 합니다.)"]}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"This pipe seems ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"rusted"}]," and needs immediate ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"repair"}],". Is it possible to fix it today?\"\r\n",["$","em","em-0",{"children":["(이 파이프가 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"녹슨"}]," 것 같고 즉시 ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"수리"}],"가 필요합니다. 오늘 수리가 가능할까요?)"]}]]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-2",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"4. 설명서 이해 및 안전 지침 따르기"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-1